  <jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">【株式の種類等】　会社法第155条第7号に該当する普通株式の取得</jpcrp_cor:ClassesOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
